---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Clara Rhee: building games solo with AI, writing an honest log of what that's actually like."
>
  <img
    class="about-photo"
    src="/images/profile.jpg"
    alt="Clara Rhee"
    width="900"
    height="675"
  />

  <p class="section-label">About</p>
  <h1>Clara Rhee</h1>

  <p>
    Hey, I'm Clara! This is my corner of the web for writing about solo
    development, AI development workflow &amp; integration, and beyond.
  </p>

  <p>
    I previously worked as a game developer / PM / producer at Krafton, on
    titles like Mega Hotel Tycoon (Roblox), The Callisto Protocol, Moonbreaker,
    an unannounced project, and most recently PUBG at PUBG Studios.
  </p>

  <p>
    In January 2026 I quit to build solo with AI. The notes here are an honest
    record of what that's actually like: the wins and the failures and the
    messy bits in between.
  </p>

  <p>
    I enjoy transparently sharing my thoughts, my battles, and my recent
    interests. If you're interested, subscribe to the <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    If you're working on something similar, or just curious, drop me a line.
    I'd love to hear from you.
  </p>

  <div class="contact">
    <a href="mailto:clararhee7@gmail.com">clararhee7@gmail.com</a>
    <span class="divider">·</span>
    <a
      href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/yong-eun-rhee-0640621a2"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
    >LinkedIn</a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Photo floats to the upper-right; the About text wraps around and below it. */
  .about-photo {
    float: right;
    width: 34%;
    max-width: 250px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin: 4px 0 18px 28px;
  }

  .section-label {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about-photo {
      float: none;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 240px;
      margin: 0 0 20px;
    }
  }

  /* Contact bar spans full width below the floated photo + text. */
  .contact {
    clear: both;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .contact a {
    margin-right: 1rem;
  }
  .contact .divider {
    color: var(--rule);
    margin-right: 1rem;
  }
</style>
